Description: Use pkg-config instead of hardcoded FHS include paths
 Screen (mode 0) and PsychHID (mode 8) hardcode /usr/include/... and Debian
 multiarch paths. Ask pkg-config instead, so the build works on Nix.
 Converts the mex calls to function syntax so the flag list can be spliced in.
Origin: Ported from Debian use_pkg-fonfig_to_obtain_triplets.patch (3.0.22.3+dfsg-4), extended to libxml2 and libusb-1.0.
